// Title: Antivirus Filter Driver Disallowed On Dev Drive - Registry
// Rule ID: 31e124fb-5dc4-42a0-83b3-44a69c77b271
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: registry_set
